---
const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<section id="journey" class="py-14 md:py-20">
  <div class="section-wrap">
    <p class="section-eyebrow">Your 60-second voting checklist</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">Four things. Then vote.</h2>
    <p class="section-deck">No guesswork: use official Alabama state resources for your individual voting information.</p>
    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <a class="glass-panel block min-h-44 p-5 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-gold/70" href="https://myinfo.alabamavotes.gov/VoterView" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-gold-soft">01 / LOCATION</p><h3 class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold">Find your poll</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-white/65">Verify the assigned place where you vote today.</p></a>
      <a class="glass-panel block min-h-44 p-5 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-gold/70" href="https://www.sos.alabama.gov/alabama-votes/voter/voter-id" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-gold-soft">02 / ID</p><h3 class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold">Bring photo ID</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-white/65">Check acceptable IDs and alternatives.</p></a>
      <a class="glass-panel block min-h-44 p-5 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-gold/70" href={`${base}counties`}><p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-gold-soft">03 / BALLOT</p><h3 class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold">Review your ballot</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-white/65">Get the official general-election sample ballot.</p></a>
      <a class="glass-panel block min-h-44 p-5 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-gold/70" href={`${base}amendments`}><p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-gold-soft">04 / DECISIONS</p><h3 class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold">Read amendments</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-white/65">Four measures, explained without endorsements.</p></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
